  "ruleText": "Int 101.02 \"Classification system program\" means the New Hampshire interpreter classification system operated by the coordinator of the program for the deaf and hard of hearing, bureau of vocational rehabilitation, department of education, as provided in PART Ed 1023.\n\nSource. #7851, eff 3-12-03; ss by #9942, INTERIM, eff 6-18-11, EXPIRED: 12-15-11\n\nNew. #10040-A, eff 12-16-11",
